    "created_at": "2025-11-14T21:46:53Z",
    "updated_at": "2025-11-14T21:46:53Z",
    "body": "This spec change seems to indicate that we're only upgrading the descendant which originally had null registry and get assigned one due to `initialize`. I got the impression that we also want to upgrade those descendants that are already assigned the given registry. Though I'm not sure if it is possible to have an element that has a registry assigned, connected but not upgraded. Only case I can think of is that the registry doesn't have the corresponding definition, but that will lead to no-op regardless, so this may not be a valid concern.",
    "author_association": "CONTRIBUTOR",
