    "created_at": "2025-11-18T06:28:17Z",
    "updated_at": "2025-11-18T06:29:29Z",
    "body": "It doesn't have to be connected to be initialized, but even with that condition removed I don't see a scenario. I could inline the null check though, that would be more aligned with how WebKit ended up implementing this, but I don't think there's a difference.",
